    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>a 64-bit integer, which product with another one is an exact 128-bit integer obtained by a single widening machine multiplication; addition and subtraction stay 64-bit and can overflow just like std::int64_t </para>
